WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.560
SCP-682 vs an M1 Abrams Tank: Who would win?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.440
While the M1 Abrams is an enduring piece of&nbsp;
military technology with strong offensive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.440
and defensive capabilities, is there&nbsp;
actually a contest to be had here?

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.120
682 has survived everything from&nbsp;
the Shy Guy to the Gate Guardian.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.400
The only thing that a tank would&nbsp;
offer is a slightly longer time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:26.240
spent unboxing 682’s meal - That being, the&nbsp;
unfortunate operatives running the tank.&nbsp;

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.400
The moral of today’s short? Don’t bring&nbsp;
a tank to an immortal anomaly fight.

